<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 3.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 3.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   116/118   123/125     UNQ     235/236</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  124/126   129/132   231/245   255/262</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices edged up slightly as some shipowners emerged late Friday to cover their requirements after the market was closed for two days from Wednesday, traders said. &quot;Volumes were healthy as some buyers emerged to buy while others were away on holidays,&quot;,&quot; said a major.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
